              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cu run buath da̱ŋ bärɔw rɔ̱ tok ce̱tnikɛ mëë ci Jo-thɛp ɛ lar. Kä cäŋɛ mëë ci wi̱i̱ diaal tekɛ buaath ti di̱t, ɛn ro̱l I-jëp te bɛlkɛ thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guäth ëë ci naath buɔth kɛ ku tok kɛ näk rɛy rööl I-jëp, cukɛ mi camkɛ röl kä Pɛro. Mëë ci Pɛro ɛ guic, cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Yɛn diaal wiaa kä Jo-thɛp kä liɛŋɛ min bɛ lar.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci buɔth ɣɔw cu thiäŋ, cu Jo-thɛp lue̱e̱k bɛɛl cu lëëp, kä cu ji̱ I-jëp cu kɔk kɛ bɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni röli diaal cu naath ben ro̱o̱l I-jëp kɛ ɣöö bikɛ bɛl ben kɔk kä Jo-thɛp, kɛ ɣöö ci buɔth naath tiam wi̱i̱ni diaal, amäni ro̱l Kɛ-naan bä.",
          "type": "text",
